===============================================
Product Name: Milk Penda – Soft & Balanced Sweetness

Enjoy the pure taste of Milk Penda, a soft and delicious traditional Indian sweet made from 100% natural ingredients. It is slow-cooked to a smooth, fudge-like texture and lightly flavored with cardamom for a classic taste.

Why You’ll Love It:

Mild Sweetness: Not too sweet, just the right amount for a gentle treat.
Soft &amp; Creamy: Smooth, melt-in-the-mouth texture that everyone loves.
Natural Ingredients: Made with only milk, sugar, and cardamom. No preservatives or artificial flavors.
Perfect For: Daily desserts, festivals, special occasions, religious offerings (Prasad), or enjoying a traditional sweet.

Storage &amp; Shelf Life:

Shelf Life: 10–12 days
Storage: Keep in a cool, dry place. Avoid warm areas to keep it soft.

=============================================

Product Name: Special Mava Penda (With Nutmeg & Cardamom)

Description: Our Mava Penda is a rich, traditional sweet that feels like a warm hug. It is made from pure Mava (slow cooked pure milk solids) which gives it a beautiful golden color and a creamy taste.

We flavor it with a mix of Nutmeg and Cardamom for a wonderful aroma. The best part is that it is not too sweet. We use a balanced amount of sugar so you can really taste the milk and the spices in every bite.

Why it is special:

Balanced Sweetness: It is mildly sweet, not sugary. Perfect if you don’t like sweets that are too heavy.
Ingredients: Made with only Mava, Sugar, Nutmeg, and Cardamom.
Texture: It is soft, thick, and melts in your mouth.
100% Natural: We make it fresh without any chemicals.
Perfect For: Daily dessert, festivals, special occasions, religious offerings (Prasad) or enjoying as a traditional dessert.

Storage Instructions:
How long it lasts: Good for 10 to 12 days.
Note: Store in a cool, dry place. Avoid keeping in warm areas to maintain texture.